@baseUrl = http://localhost:8088

### Reset
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/outbox-inbox/reset

### 1. BAD baseline: DB commits, execution stops before broker publish -> 500
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/outbox-inbox/naive/orders?stopAfterCommit=true
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reference": "ORD-NAIVE-001",
  "customerId": "C-NAIVE",
  "totalAmount": 100.00
}

### DB contains order, broker has no event.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/outbox-inbox/state

### Reset
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/outbox-inbox/reset

### 2. GOOD: business state + outbox row commit together
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/outbox-inbox/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reference": "ORD-OUTBOX-001",
  "customerId": "C-OUTBOX",
  "totalAmount": 200.00
}

### Order + unpublished outbox row exist; broker still empty.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/outbox-inbox/state

### 3. Relay publishes, then execution stops before marking outbox row -> 500
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/outbox-inbox/relay?stopAfterPublish=true

### Broker has 1 message, outbox is still unpublished.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/outbox-inbox/state

### 4. Relay runs again: SAME event is published again, then acknowledged
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/outbox-inbox/relay

### Broker now contains duplicate event IDs.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/outbox-inbox/state

### 5. Consume first delivery -> PROCESSED
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/outbox-inbox/consume/0

### 6. Consume duplicate delivery -> DUPLICATE
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/outbox-inbox/consume/1

### processedMessages=1 and loyalty account effect happened once.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/outbox-inbox/state
